        "config": {
          "text": "A pad that pumps with the kick drum: the classic dance-music sidechain. Press Space to play.\n\nThe Sidechain Ducker turns the pad down every time the kick hits and lets it swell back in between, so the pad breathes in time with the beat. The kick is only the ducker's key: it is heard through the Mix, not through the ducker."
        },
