        "config": {
          "text": "Try this:\n• Click Pump to switch the ducking off and on and hear the difference.\n• Turn Release down to 0.125 beats for a tight, choppy pump, or up to 0.75 for a slow swell that never quite lets go.\n• Raise the ducker's amount for a deeper dip, or its attack for a softer one.\n• Wire Hats and snare's out into the sidechain instead and hear every hit duck the pad."
